        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global Door Controls Concealed Vertical Rod Exit Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe DC-CVR panic devices blend the utility of a vertical rod application with the appearance of a traditional panic device. <b>Concealed Vertical Rods</b>: Rods are installed inside the door.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThey are non-handed and reversible with a contoured cross bar that will fit doors up to 42\" wide and can be field sized to accommodate narrow doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nFeatures and Specifications: </b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Contoured anodized aluminum cross  bar, stainless steel springs, stainless steel latch</li>\r\n<li>Latch Box Size: 1-1/4\" wide x 7-1/4\" long</li>\r\n<li>Latch Throw: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 1-5/32\" from edge of door to center line of device</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Rim mounted roller strike with shim</li>\r\n<li>Bar Projection: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile Width: 1-7/8\" minimum</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Reversible, non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Door Height: Up to 84\"  (7 Ft) - field sizable. Add <a href=\"/products/1-foot-concealed-vertical-rod-extension\"><b>1 Foot Extension</b></a> for 8 foot doors or <a href=\"/products/3-foot-concealed-vertical-rod-extension\"><b>3 Foot Extension</b></a> for 10 foot doors.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" standard</li>\r\n<li>Door Width: Up to 42\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Height: 35-11/16\" from floor to center line of the bottom latch case mounting stud</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: Furnished with sheet metal, machine screws and shoulder mounting studs with set screws</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Accepts mortise cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Dogging: Inside - push up dog pin rotate with screwdriver, Outside - by keyed mortise cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Grade 2</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 10 Years</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DC-CVR-Installation_instructions.pdf?v=1704262216\"><b>DC-CVR Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor exterior entry an optional <a href=\"/products/mortise-lock-cylinder-with-mounting-pad-global-th1100-bc-cvrpad\"><b>mortise lock cylinder and mounting trim plate</b></a> are offered below.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in Aluminum or Duronotic (Dark Bronze).\r\n</p>",
